			"path": "src/gui/Src/Gui/BreakpointsView.cpp-simstep-7c7df7cb-dc59-4fb0-add7-2ce385120253",
			"fileName": "BreakpointsView.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `BreakpointsView` is updated to display the new hardware breakpoint, including its address, type, and status.",
