		"src/bridge/bridgemain.cpp-simstep-b97167e8-06e2-426a-95fe-e8a58ea36b52": {
			"path": "src/bridge/bridgemain.cpp-simstep-b97167e8-06e2-426a-95fe-e8a58ea36b52",
			"fileName": "bridgemain.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `DbgMemRead` function in the bridge layer receives the request. It communicates with the debugger core to read the specified number of bytes from the debugged process's memory.",
			"cellName": "Memory Map Flow: Read Memory from Target Process - bridgemain.cpp:L511-522",
