		"src/gui/Src/Gui/CPUStack.cpp-simstep-078083eb-822d-4a38-82f4-697fc99396e1": {
			"path": "src/gui/Src/Gui/CPUStack.cpp-simstep-078083eb-822d-4a38-82f4-697fc99396e1",
			"fileName": "CPUStack.cpp",
			"wiki": "When the debugger pauses execution, the `CPUStack` view is automatically updated to reflect the current state of the stack. The `stackDumpAt` function is called with the current stack pointer's address (`csp`).",
			"cellName": "Stack Flow: Update Stack View on Pause - CPUStack.cpp:L563-570",
			"cellId": "fb7f6990-088d-4f5d-b489-ea0c87306ffc",
