			"fileName": "CPUStack.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `getColumnRichText` function processes the raw stack bytes. It interprets each value, checking if it is a pointer to code or data, resolving symbols, identifying stack frame boundaries, and formatting the output for a rich, user-friendly display.",
			"cellName": "Stack Flow: Interpret and Display Stack Contents - CPUStack.cpp:L316-371",
