			"wiki": "The command handler calls `TraceRecord.enableTraceRecording`. This function opens the specified file for writing and sets a boolean flag (`rtEnabled`) to indicate that trace recording is active.",
			"cellName": "Trace Recording: Backend Enables Recording - TraceRecord.cpp:L502-550",
			"cellId": "c1313ed4-38f3-477d-a018-6fa1b0b0fd5f",
