			"fileName": "bridgemain.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `DbgMemWrite` call is executed by the debugger core, modifying the target memory. The `on_listPatches_itemChanged` function then calls `GuiUpdateAllViews()` to ensure all UI components, like the Disassembly and Dump views, reflect the change.",
			"cellName": "Memory is Modified and UI is Refreshed - bridgemain.cpp:L532-547",
			"cellId": "1820918c-48e6-4b34-8a8f-f05bda7d0397",
