			"startLine": 968,
			"endLine": 971,
			"parentCellId": "f068423f-825e-49db-ab3f-9988853535ef",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/module.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Symbol and Module Management",
					"simStepId": "4b7a6ba2-c871-433a-bf4c-9e7facb3f2d8"
				}
			]
		},
		"64830681-5b54-4729-83bc-4ddc65491cc4": {
			"path": "64830681-5b54-4729-83bc-4ddc65491cc4",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Instantiate DIA Symbol Source - module.cpp:L1409-1436",
			"cellId": "64830681-5b54-4729-83bc-4ddc65491cc4",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "f068423f-825e-49db-ab3f-9988853535ef"
		},
		"src/dbg/module.cpp-simstep-bbfea96f-f356-4a38-9a67-c629762e0756": {
			"path": "src/dbg/module.cpp-simstep-bbfea96f-f356-4a38-9a67-c629762e0756",
			"fileName": "module.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `MODINFO::loadSymbols` method checks if the Microsoft Debug Interface Access (DIA) SDK is available. If so, it creates an instance of `SymbolSourceDIA` and calls its `loadPDB` method to begin the loading and parsing process.",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Instantiate DIA Symbol Source - module.cpp:L1409-1436",
			"cellId": "64830681-5b54-4729-83bc-4ddc65491cc4",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 1409,
			"endLine": 1436,
			"parentCellId": "f068423f-825e-49db-ab3f-9988853535ef",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/module.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Symbol and Module Management",
					"simStepId": "bbfea96f-f356-4a38-9a67-c629762e0756"
				}
			]
		},
		"ea163a31-383d-4138-91dc-dec14cb167a5": {
			"path": "ea163a31-383d-4138-91dc-dec14cb167a5",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Validate PDB and Start Async Parsing - symbolsourcedia.cpp:L42-69",
			"cellId": "ea163a31-383d-4138-91dc-dec14cb167a5",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "4fb0aeb5-ef9a-4be7-b096-98230f0ff8f6"
		},
		"src/dbg/symbolsourcedia.cpp-simstep-300dd94c-342c-48e5-bf62-1cee735f5d0e": {
			"path": "src/dbg/symbolsourcedia.cpp-simstep-300dd94c-342c-48e5-bf62-1cee735f5d0e",
			"fileName": "symbolsourcedia.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `SymbolSourceDIA::loadPDB` function first validates that the provided PDB file matches the module using `PDBDiaFile::open`. If validation is successful, it creates background threads (`SymbolsThread`, `SourceLinesThread`) to parse the symbols and source line information asynchronously, preventing the UI from freezing.",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Validate PDB and Start Async Parsing - symbolsourcedia.cpp:L42-69",
			"cellId": "ea163a31-383d-4138-91dc-dec14cb167a5",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 42,
			"endLine": 69,
			"parentCellId": "4fb0aeb5-ef9a-4be7-b096-98230f0ff8f6",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/symbolsourcedia.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Symbol and Module Management",
					"simStepId": "300dd94c-342c-48e5-bf62-1cee735f5d0e"
				}
			]
		},
		"182e539d-4372-44d0-a698-e7134dc09040": {
			"path": "182e539d-4372-44d0-a698-e7134dc09040",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Core DIA SDK Interaction - pdbdiafile.cpp:L239-384",
			"cellId": "182e539d-4372-44d0-a698-e7134dc09040",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "16a7ce76-509c-4d63-9b5b-10d0e2828a27"
		},
		"src/dbg/pdbdiafile.cpp-simstep-237b20a4-0a0c-4748-889f-37be9c06f145": {
			"path": "src/dbg/pdbdiafile.cpp-simstep-237b20a4-0a0c-4748-889f-37be9c06f145",
			"fileName": "pdbdiafile.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `PDBDiaFile::open` function performs the core interaction with the Microsoft DIA SDK. It initializes COM, creates a DIA data source, loads the PDB file, opens a DIA session, and crucially, validates that the PDB's GUID and age match the data from the executable, ensuring the correct symbols are loaded.",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Core DIA SDK Interaction - pdbdiafile.cpp:L239-384",
			"cellId": "182e539d-4372-44d0-a698-e7134dc09040",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 239,
			"endLine": 384,
			"parentCellId": "16a7ce76-509c-4d63-9b5b-10d0e2828a27",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/pdbdiafile.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Symbol and Module Management",
					"simStepId": "237b20a4-0a0c-4748-889f-37be9c06f145"
				}
			]
		},
		"5283f8dd-ca2d-41e5-8682-687b84aaabfc": {
			"path": "5283f8dd-ca2d-41e5-8682-687b84aaabfc",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Asynchronous Symbol Parsing - symbolsourcedia.cpp:L113-169",
			"cellId": "5283f8dd-ca2d-41e5-8682-687b84aaabfc",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "4fb0aeb5-ef9a-4be7-b096-98230f0ff8f6"
		},
		"src/dbg/symbolsourcedia.cpp-simstep-9ee3235f-15e2-4baf-821e-07b8b1a69777": {
			"path": "src/dbg/symbolsourcedia.cpp-simstep-9ee3235f-15e2-4baf-821e-07b8b1a69777",
			"fileName": "symbolsourcedia.cpp",
			"wiki": "In a background thread, the `loadSymbolsAsync` function re-opens the PDB and calls `enumerateLexicalHierarchy`. This traverses the entire symbol tree within the PDB file, and a callback function processes each symbol, adding it to the debugger's internal data structures.",
			"cellName": "[Auto-load] Asynchronous Symbol Parsing - symbolsourcedia.cpp:L113-169",
			"cellId": "5283f8dd-ca2d-41e5-8682-687b84aaabfc",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 113,
			"endLine": 169,
			"parentCellId": "4fb0aeb5-ef9a-4be7-b096-98230f0ff8f6",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/symbolsourcedia.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Symbol and Module Management",
					"simStepId": "9ee3235f-15e2-4baf-821e-07b8b1a69777"
				}
			]
		},
		"0d195f71-e4ee-453f-aee4-2028efd5941e": {
			"path": "0d195f71-e4ee-453f-aee4-2028efd5941e",
			"cellName": "[Manual-download] User Initiates Symbol Download - cmd-analysis.cpp:L199-204",
