			"fileName": "symbolinfo.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `SymDownloadSymbol` function retrieves the PDB signature and filename for the specified module. It then constructs the full download URL and the corresponding local cache path according to the standard symbol server layout (`CachePath\\PDBName\\Signature\\PDBName`).",
			"cellName": "[Manual-download] Prepare Download URL and Cache Path - symbolinfo.cpp:L206-290",
