			"fileName": "downslib.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `downslib_download` function uses the WinINet API to handle the HTTP download. It connects to the symbol server, requests the file, reads the response in chunks, and writes the data to the destination file in the local symbol cache. A callback provides progress updates to the GUI.",
			"cellName": "[Manual-download] Download PDB File - downslib.cpp:L18-150",
			"cellId": "66751612-9c58-478e-a069-541f7d3437f2",
			"visible": true,
