			"fileName": "symbolinfo.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `SymDownloadSymbol` function now calls `info->loadSymbols` with the path to the downloaded PDB file. This merges the manual download flow with the automatic loading flow, proceeding to validate and parse the local PDB file as described in the previous steps.",
