		"ee9fb2cf-ee95-4880-9eab-80fcb6b097f6": {
			"path": "ee9fb2cf-ee95-4880-9eab-80fcb6b097f6",
			"cellName": "User Executes `plugload` Command - cmd-plugins.cpp:L48-52",
			"cellId": "ee9fb2cf-ee95-4880-9eab-80fcb6b097f6",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "198062d7-560e-47b3-8fd9-569607b4123f"
		},
		"src/dbg/commands/cmd-plugins.cpp-simstep-8c477022-e7f7-4b07-ae98-08c17a423bae": {
			"path": "src/dbg/commands/cmd-plugins.cpp-simstep-8c477022-e7f7-4b07-ae98-08c17a423bae",
			"fileName": "cmd-plugins.cpp",
			"wiki": "The user initiates the plugin loading process by executing the `plugload` command in the debugger's command interface, specifying the name of the plugin to be loaded.",
			"cellName": "User Executes `plugload` Command - cmd-plugins.cpp:L48-52",
			"cellId": "ee9fb2cf-ee95-4880-9eab-80fcb6b097f6",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 48,
			"endLine": 52,
			"parentCellId": "198062d7-560e-47b3-8fd9-569607b4123f",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/commands/cmd-plugins.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Extensibility via Plugins",
					"simStepId": "8c477022-e7f7-4b07-ae98-08c17a423bae"
				}
			]
		},
		"d86add35-6e01-4e5c-9c8a-9d49236f608d": {
			"path": "d86add35-6e01-4e5c-9c8a-9d49236f608d",
			"cellName": "Load Plugin DLL - plugin_loader.cpp:L157-214",
			"cellId": "d86add35-6e01-4e5c-9c8a-9d49236f608d",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd"
		},
		"src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-ea042377-8e5d-4dab-a51a-c3147a3bc0e4": {
			"path": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-ea042377-8e5d-4dab-a51a-c3147a3bc0e4",
			"fileName": "plugin_loader.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `pluginload` function resolves the full path to the plugin's DLL file and loads it into the debugger's process space using the Windows `LoadLibraryExW` API.",
			"cellName": "Load Plugin DLL - plugin_loader.cpp:L157-214",
			"cellId": "d86add35-6e01-4e5c-9c8a-9d49236f608d",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 157,
			"endLine": 214,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Extensibility via Plugins",
					"simStepId": "ea042377-8e5d-4dab-a51a-c3147a3bc0e4"
				}
			]
		},
		"38430e55-e541-4904-84c0-d1b457e3e6bf": {
			"path": "38430e55-e541-4904-84c0-d1b457e3e6bf",
			"cellName": "Initialize Plugin - plugin_loader.cpp:L232-239",
			"cellId": "38430e55-e541-4904-84c0-d1b457e3e6bf",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd"
		},
		"src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-8c2d3bf0-7342-48a1-bb5a-43da3f5586d5": {
			"path": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-8c2d3bf0-7342-48a1-bb5a-43da3f5586d5",
			"fileName": "plugin_loader.cpp",
			"wiki": "The debugger calls the retrieved `pluginit` function from the plugin. It passes a `PLUG_INITSTRUCT` structure that the plugin must fill with its information, such as its name and version. The plugin performs its initial setup and returns `true` on success.",
			"cellName": "Initialize Plugin - plugin_loader.cpp:L232-239",
			"cellId": "38430e55-e541-4904-84c0-d1b457e3e6bf",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 232,
			"endLine": 239,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Extensibility via Plugins",
					"simStepId": "8c2d3bf0-7342-48a1-bb5a-43da3f5586d5"
				}
			]
		},
		"0cfede9c-66a4-4763-9916-f994967c46c5": {
			"path": "0cfede9c-66a4-4763-9916-f994967c46c5",
			"cellName": "Register Event Callbacks - plugin_loader.cpp:L647-653",
			"cellId": "0cfede9c-66a4-4763-9916-f994967c46c5",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd"
		},
		"src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-fcdcb2c8-8203-45ad-a811-0500a0833e62": {
			"path": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-fcdcb2c8-8203-45ad-a811-0500a0833e62",
			"fileName": "plugin_loader.cpp",
			"wiki": "Upon successful initialization, plugins can register callback functions for various debugger events. The debugger may auto-discover exported callbacks (e.g., `CBBREAKPOINT`) or the plugin can explicitly call `_plugin_registercallback` to subscribe to events like breakpoint hits, process creation, etc.",
			"cellName": "Register Event Callbacks - plugin_loader.cpp:L647-653",
			"cellId": "0cfede9c-66a4-4763-9916-f994967c46c5",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 647,
			"endLine": 653,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Extensibility via Plugins",
					"simStepId": "fcdcb2c8-8203-45ad-a811-0500a0833e62"
				}
			]
		},
		"d114a722-f2f8-4373-8fb2-7fc0a71dd89a": {
			"path": "d114a722-f2f8-4373-8fb2-7fc0a71dd89a",
			"cellName": "Debugger Hits Breakpoint - debugger.cpp:L958-966",
			"cellId": "d114a722-f2f8-4373-8fb2-7fc0a71dd89a",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "abf8f82a-7554-4436-b28a-1a87bbf5d7c0"
		},
		"src/dbg/debugger.cpp-simstep-1cff6d4e-8b7f-4a28-90e8-c98849345c96": {
			"path": "src/dbg/debugger.cpp-simstep-1cff6d4e-8b7f-4a28-90e8-c98849345c96",
			"fileName": "debugger.cpp",
			"wiki": "During a debugging session, the debuggee executes an instruction that triggers a breakpoint. The debugger's main event loop catches this event and begins processing it.",
			"cellName": "Debugger Hits Breakpoint - debugger.cpp:L958-966",
			"cellId": "d114a722-f2f8-4373-8fb2-7fc0a71dd89a",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 958,
			"endLine": 966,
			"parentCellId": "abf8f82a-7554-4436-b28a-1a87bbf5d7c0",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/debugger.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Extensibility via Plugins",
					"simStepId": "1cff6d4e-8b7f-4a28-90e8-c98849345c96"
				}
			]
		},
		"b8964ec8-5a31-42de-86ea-636704f048ca": {
			"path": "b8964ec8-5a31-42de-86ea-636704f048ca",
			"cellName": "Invoke Registered Callbacks - plugin_loader.cpp:L664-678",
			"cellId": "b8964ec8-5a31-42de-86ea-636704f048ca",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd"
		},
		"src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-88f8bb66-bde7-4559-8328-bc31d190543b": {
			"path": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp-simstep-88f8bb66-bde7-4559-8328-bc31d190543b",
			"fileName": "plugin_loader.cpp",
			"wiki": "The `plugincbcall` function looks up the list of registered callbacks for the given event type (`CB_BREAKPOINT`). It then iterates through this list and invokes each plugin's registered handler function.",
			"cellName": "Invoke Registered Callbacks - plugin_loader.cpp:L664-678",
			"cellId": "b8964ec8-5a31-42de-86ea-636704f048ca",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 664,
			"endLine": 678,
			"parentCellId": "b027cdfe-9245-4294-8d1a-dfe1731ea3cd",
			"parentPath": "src/dbg/plugin_loader.cpp",
			"simSteps": [
				{
					"simulationKey": "Extensibility via Plugins",
					"simStepId": "88f8bb66-bde7-4559-8328-bc31d190543b"
				}
			]
		},
		"fa626c17-3b7d-4e45-9d27-4cc6d20c2244": {
			"path": "fa626c17-3b7d-4e45-9d27-4cc6d20c2244",
			"cellName": "Plugin Executes Custom Logic - basics.md:L26-31",
			"cellId": "fa626c17-3b7d-4e45-9d27-4cc6d20c2244",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "aa5b4af1-8a9c-4dc8-998c-30340dfb341e"
		},
		"docs/developers/plugins/basics.md-simstep-1c78db3d-6db7-48a8-af8b-c262e763376f": {
			"path": "docs/developers/plugins/basics.md-simstep-1c78db3d-6db7-48a8-af8b-c262e763376f",
			"fileName": "basics.md",
			"wiki": "The code inside the plugin's callback function is now executed. The plugin can use the provided event data to perform any number of custom actions, such as logging information, modifying registers or memory, adding GUI elements, or automating analysis tasks.",
			"cellName": "Plugin Executes Custom Logic - basics.md:L26-31",
			"cellId": "fa626c17-3b7d-4e45-9d27-4cc6d20c2244",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 26,
			"endLine": 31,
			"parentCellId": "aa5b4af1-8a9c-4dc8-998c-30340dfb341e",
			"parentPath": "docs/developers/plugins/basics.md",
			"simSteps": [
