							"loadCurrentGraphSlot"
						]
					},
					"inputDataExample": "{}",
					"outputDataExample": "{\"status\": \"Graph view refreshed to display new comment.\"}"
				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>The ability to understand and annotate disassembled code is a core reverse engineering activity</li><li>- View live, interactive disassembly of the code being executed</li><li>- Annotate the code by adding labels, comments, and bookmarks to build a knowledge base of the target program</li><li>- Generate and navigate a control flow graph (CFG) to visually understand the structure of functions, including loops and branches</li><li>- Find cross-references (xrefs) to code locations and data addresses to see how they are used</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
