					"simStepLabel": "[Auto-load] Attempt to Load Symbols",
					"simStepDescription": "Inside `ModLoad`, the code iterates through the list of potential PDB file locations and calls the `MODINFO::loadSymbols` method for each path, stopping once the symbols are successfully loaded.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
