					"simStepLabel": "[Auto-load] Instantiate DIA Symbol Source",
					"simStepDescription": "The `MODINFO::loadSymbols` method checks if the Microsoft Debug Interface Access (DIA) SDK is available. If so, it creates an instance of `SymbolSourceDIA` and calls its `loadPDB` method to begin the loading and parsing process.",
					"isEdge": 0,
